# Variant check: Son (2017) continuous-gap MOVABLE pintle on the 13 kN
# sea-level LOX/RP-1 benchmark operating point.
#
# Companion to examples/cli/test_13kn_sealevel_regen_allstl.args — the movable
# architecture (--injector-architecture son_continuous_movable) replaces the
# fixed discrete radial exits, so it cannot share the machined coaxial CAD
# benchmark run.  Operating point, chamber, and feed values are identical to
# the main benchmark file (provenance documented there).  Without a measured
# Cd map / metrology / actuator artifacts the movable model runs in its
# labelled constant-Cd screening mode and the release gates stay
# evidence-blocked — that is the expected result of this check, not a FAIL.
#
#   PYTHONPATH=. python -m raosim @examples/cli/test_13kn_movable_pintle.args

--no-banner

# Operating point (same as main benchmark).
--propellant LOX/RP-1
--oxidizer LOX
--fuel RP-1
--pc 3.0e6
--target-thrust 13000
--epsilon 4.524
--pa-over-p0 0.033775
--length-pct 80

# Chamber and throat (same as main benchmark).
--l-star 1.0
--contraction-ratio 3.0
--minimum-cylindrical-length 0.03
--ru-factor 1.5

# Seed contour: this variant checks the movable-injector model chain, not the
# MOC solve (the main benchmark owns the full --max-nfev 4000 solve).
--max-nfev 0

# Movable pintle architecture (Son 2017 Eq. (1) continuous annular gap;
# raosim/movable_pintle.py, docs/MOVABLE_PINTLE_MODEL.md).  Openings default
# to the model's derived stop; constant-Cd screening mode is labelled in the
# manifest because no Cd-map artifact is supplied.
--injector pintle
--pintle-radial-stream fuel
--pintle-target-momentum-ratio 0.52
--pintle-radial-exit continuous_radial_gap
--injector-architecture son_continuous_movable
# Movable hardware dimensions: the repo's documented CLI example set
# (docs/MOVABLE_PINTLE_MODEL.md §CLI usage; post OD 20 mm, post wall 1 mm,
# rod 8 mm) with the center gap flow-sized 12 -> 14 mm so the open-stop
# capacity below the center-gap transition passes the 13 kN fuel flow
# (1.595 kg/s required vs 1.29 kg/s at the 12 mm doc example; area scales
# with D^2, disclosed sizing, not a literature dimension).
--movable-post-diameter 0.020
--movable-post-thickness 0.001
--movable-center-gap-diameter 0.014
--movable-pintle-rod-diameter 0.008

# Feed system (same fractions as main benchmark) so injector dp and feed
# gates resolve.
--fuel-tank-pressure 500000
--oxidizer-tank-pressure 600000
--fuel-supply-pressure 5000000
--oxidizer-supply-pressure 4500000
--fuel-injector-dp-fraction 0.20
--oxidizer-injector-dp-fraction 0.20
--fuel-line-loss-fraction 0.02
--oxidizer-line-loss-fraction 0.02
--fuel-manifold-loss-fraction 0.02
--oxidizer-manifold-loss-fraction 0.02
--fuel-control-margin-fraction 0.05
--oxidizer-control-margin-fraction 0.05

--out builds/tests/13kn_movable_pintle
